{"id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel.md","title":"GL Finite Countermodel Lemma","display":"lem-gl-finite-countermodel — GL Finite Countermodel Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","aliases":["89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel"],"display":"lem-gl-finite-countermodel — GL Finite Countermodel Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-semantic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-finite-countermodel — GL Finite Countermodel Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5026751112f75f31\" href=\"?note=5026751112f75f31\" title=\"89-df-gl-finite-model\">89-df-gl-finite-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f2ee867f14428e3\" href=\"?note=7f2ee867f14428e3\" title=\"89-df-gl-semantic\">89-df-gl-semantic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For every set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> of Kripke models,\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span> is its finite-GL-model subclass and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span> is global GL-model truth on\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\;\n\\bigl((M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\;\n\\bigl((M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个非定理有有限反模型</li>\n<li>这是 FMP 的直接表述</li>\n<li>这是可判定性的基础</li>\n<li>集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 与两个源定义的真实签名一致；对取得的有限\n反模型可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U=\\{M\\}\">\\(\\mathcal U=\\{M\\}\\)</span>，无需把所有模型组成一个真类式集合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-finite-model","status":"resolved","id":"5026751112f75f31","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"7f2ee867f14428e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-semantic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\;\n\\bigl((M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U=\\{M\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1208,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0adaf80b9cae9e6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5026751112f75f31","0006800fa1c85177","7f2ee867f14428e3"]}